Ontology(<http://example.org/nov.owl>

Declaration(Annotation(<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <http://example.org/nov.owl>) Class(<http://example.org/A>))
Declaration(Class(<http://example.org/B>))
Declaration(AnnotationProperty(<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom>))

